{
  "_about": "Reviewed goldfish mana of every card in the 21 decks that is a land or has mana text (\"add\", \"adds\", \"produces\", a land search, a change to the land types of lands) (owner-approved mana model, 2026-11-19; fix pass and review rounds 1 to 4, 2026-11-20). Each value is read off the card's text, not computed by the parser. Atoms: one mana a turn each, colours in WUBRGC order; 'cmd' = the commander's colours (titan-convergence: C), 'C+cmd' = {C} and those colours. mana: lasting mana a turn with the card alone; once: one-shot mana; leaves: spending the one-shot mana sacrifices it; rearm: mana that untaps a spent one-shot source; oneColour: all of one activation's mana is one colour; landGrant: colours every land can make while it is on the battlefield; eachLandIs: the basic land type a land gives every land while it is on the battlefield (Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth: Swamp); everyNonbasicType: the land has every nonbasic land type (CR 205.3i: Cave, Desert, Gate and the rest; Planar Nexus), none of the basic ones; from: now / next (non-lands); taps: the ability it is tapped for mana by has {T} (a creature tapped for mana then does not attack, unless it has vigilance: M9, it attacks first and pays after combat); entry: how a land enters; entryCost: lands it sacrifices or returns as it enters (count; now: before it enters, else by its entering trigger after they are tapped; toHand: returned to the hand); crack: a fetch land, cracked as it is played: the land types it finds (none: any basic), basic only, whether the land enters tapped and the search's own untap condition; findsByDeck: documentation only, the colours of each deck's lands a typed fetch can find; imprint: the card an imprint exiles from the hand (colorless, nonartifact, nonland, minValue) and the mana it then makes (atoms, or 'colors': one of the exiled card's colours); faces: a Pathway's two faces; board: terms evaluated on the goldfish's own battlefield; onCast: mana per spell cast while it is out; turns: a Saga's turns of mana; ramp: lands a spell or entering trigger moves; fetch: a land-fetching permanent (tapsSelf: its cost has {T}). A card with no fields gives nothing (see note); a note-only entry may also name a card with no mana text whose mana the goldfish does not model (a named floor: mana tokens, untappers, cost reducers). Checked by GoldfishManaTableGuardTests.",
